text":"Gina"},{"key":"C","text":"Alice"},{"key":"D","text":"Jack"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"This is my sister, Gina 说明姐姐是 Gina。","verify":"\"Gina\""},{"id":"cne_j012_q2","topicId":"cne_j012","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"This is my family. These are my parents. This is my sister, Gina. 哪一句和短文一致？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Gina is the speaker's brother."},{"key":"B","text":"The speaker has no parents."},{"key":"C","text":"Gina is the speaker's sister."},{"key":"D","text":"Gina is a parent."}],"answer":"C","explanation":"短文说 This is my sister, Gina。","verify":"\"Gina is the speaker's sister.\""},{"id":"cne_j012_q3","topicId":"cne_j012","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"I have a brother. His name is Tom. I have no sister. 说话人有姐姐吗？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"有一个"},{"key":"B","text":"有两个"},{"key":"C","text":"短文没说"},{"key":"D","text":"没有"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"I have no sister 是没有姐姐或妹妹。","verify":"\"没有\""},{"id":"cne_j012_q4","topicId":"cne_j012","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"I have a brother. His name is Tom. I have no sister. Tom 是谁？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"说话人的弟弟或哥哥"},{"key":"B","text":"说话人的姐姐"},{"key":"C","text":"说话人的父母"},{"key":"D","text":"说话人的老师"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"His name is Tom 指 brother。","verify":"\"说话人的弟弟或哥哥\""},{"id":"cne_j023_q1","topicId":"cne_j023","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"I ___ a brother. 横线处填哪一个？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"have"},{"key":"B","text":"has"},{"key":"C","text":"am"},{"key":"D","text":"is"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"I 后面用 have。","verify":"\"have\""},{"id":"cne_j023_q2","topicId":"cne_j023","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"She ___ a red hat. 横线处填哪一个？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"have"},{"key":"B","text":"has"},{"key":"C","text":"are"},{"key":"D","text":"haves"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"She 后面用 has。","verify":"\"has\""},{"id":"cne_j023_q3","topicId":"cne_j023","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"They ___ two sons. 横线处填哪一个？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"has"},{"key":"B","text":"haves"},{"key":"C","text":"have"},{"key":"D","text":"is"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"They 后面用 have。","verify":"\"have\""},{"id":"cne_j023_q4","topicId":"cne_j023","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一句是正确的？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"He have a ping-pong bat."},{"key":"B","text":"He haves a ping-pong bat."},{"key":"C","text":"He have bat a."},{"key":"D","text":"He has a ping-pong bat."}],"answer":"D","explanation":"He 用 has。","verify":"\"He has a ping-pong bat.\""},{"id":"cne_j024_q1","topicId":"cne_j024","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"___ you play chess? 横线处填哪一个？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Does"},{"key":"B","text":"Do"},{"key":"C","text":"Are"},{"key":"D","text":"Is"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"you 用 Do。","verify":"\"Do\""},{"id":"cne_j024_q2","topicId":"cne_j024","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"___ she have a piano? 横线处填哪一个？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Do"},{"key":"B","text":"Is"},{"key":"C","text":"Does"},{"key":"D","text":"Has"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"she 用 Does，后面动词用原形 have。","verify":"\"Does\""},{"id":"cne_j024_q3","topicId":"cne_j024","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"他不踢足球。哪一句正确？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"He don't play football."},{"key":"B","text":"He doesn't plays football."},{"key":"C","text":"He not play football."},{"key":"D","text":"He doesn't play football."}],"answer":"D","explanation":"doesn't 后面用动词原形 play。","verify":"\"He doesn't play football.\""},{"id":"cne_j024_q4","topicId":"cne_j024","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"Do they read every evening? 肯定简答是哪一句？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Yes, they do."},{"key":"B","text":"Yes, they have."},{"key":"C","text":"Yes, they does."},{"key":"D","text":"Yes, they are."}],"answer":"A","explanation":"Do 提问用 do 回答。","verify":"\"Yes, they do.\""},{"id":"cne_j079_q1","topicId":"cne_j079","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice",