ll and handsome hair."},{"key":"C","text":"My grandfather are tall and handsome."},{"key":"D","text":"My grandfather is tall and handsome."}],"answer":"D","explanation":"高和英俊都用 is，不用 has。","verify":"\"My grandfather is tall and handsome.\""},{"id":"cne_j080_q4","topicId":"cne_j080","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"What does he look like? 这句在问什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"他长什么样"},{"key":"B","text":"他喜欢什么"},{"key":"C","text":"他看起来在看书"},{"key":"D","text":"他来自哪里"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"look like 问外貌，不是问喜好。","verify":"\"他长什么样\""},{"id":"cne_j081_q1","topicId":"cne_j081","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"想问你哥哥长什么样，哪一句合适？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"What does your brother like?"},{"key":"B","text":"What is your brother look like?"},{"key":"C","text":"What does your brother look like?"},{"key":"D","text":"How does your brother look like?"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"问外貌用 What does ... look like。What does he like 是问喜好。","verify":"\"What does your brother look like?\""},{"id":"cne_j081_q2","topicId":"cne_j081","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"她个子矮，应怎么说？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"She has short."},{"key":"B","text":"She is a short."},{"key":"C","text":"She wears short."},{"key":"D","text":"She is short."}],"answer":"D","explanation":"矮用 is short。","verify":"\"She is short.\""},{"id":"cne_j081_q3","topicId":"cne_j081","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"He has short grey hair. 这句话的意思是什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"他留着花白的短发"},{"key":"B","text":"他很高"},{"key":"C","text":"他很英俊所以头发长"},{"key":"D","text":"他戴着帽子"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"short grey hair 是花白短发。","verify":"\"他留着花白的短发\""},{"id":"cne_j081_q4","topicId":"cne_j081","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"想说那个男孩又高又英俊，哪一句合适？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"The boy has tall and handsome."},{"key":"B","text":"The boy is tall and handsome."},{"key":"C","text":"The boy is tall and handsome hair."},{"key":"D","text":"The boy are tall and handsome."}],"answer":"B","explanation":"is 加两个形容词。","verify":"\"The boy is tall and handsome.\""},{"id":"cne_j082_q1","topicId":"cne_j082","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"This is my family. My grandfather is tall and handsome. He has short grey hair. My sister is short. She has long brown hair. 爷爷高吗？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"矮"},{"key":"B","text":"和姐姐一样矮"},{"key":"C","text":"短文没说"},{"key":"D","text":"高"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"My grandfather is tall。","verify":"\"高\""},{"id":"cne_j082_q2","topicId":"cne_j082","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"This is my family. My grandfather is tall and handsome. He has short grey hair. My sister is short. She has long brown hair. 姐姐的头发是什么样的？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"长的棕色头发"},{"key":"B","text":"花白短发"},{"key":"C","text":"短的黑发"},{"key":"D","text":"没有头发"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"long brown hair。","verify":"\"长的棕色头发\""},{"id":"cne_j082_q3","topicId":"cne_j082","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"This is my family. My grandfather is tall and handsome. He has short grey hair. My sister is short. She has long brown hair. 爷爷的头发是什么样的？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"棕色长发"},{"key":"B","text":"花白的短发"},{"key":"C","text":"金色卷发"},{"key":"D","text":"短文没说"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"short grey hair。","verify":"\"花白的短发\""},{"id":"cne_j082_q4","topicId":"cne_j082","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"This is my family. My grandfather is tall and handsome. He has short grey hair. My sister is short. She has long brown hair. 哪一句和短文一致？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"My sister is tall."},{"key":"B","text":"Grandfather has long hair."},{"key":"C","text":"My sister is short."},{"key":"D","text":"My sister is handsome in this text."}],"answer":"C","explanation":"姐姐个子矮。爷爷高，而且头发短。","verify":"\"My sister is short.\""},{"id":"cne_j246_q1","topicId":"cne_j246","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"This is ____ bike. 这是 Lucy 的自行车。","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Lucy's"},{"key":"B","text":"Lucys"},{"key":"C","text":"Lucy"},{"key":"D","text":"Lucys'"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"单个人名后加 's。","verify":"\"Lucy's\""},{"id":"cne_j246_q2","topicId":"cne_j246","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"「我父母的房间」正确写法是？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"my parents's room"},{"key":"B","text":"my parents room's"},{"key":"C","text":"my parent's room"},{"key":"D","text":"my parents' room"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"以 s 结尾的复数名词只加 '。","verify":"\"my parents' room\""},{"id":"cne_j246_q3","topicId":"cne_j246","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"Jack's sister is 12. 句中 's 表示？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"所属关系「的」"},{"key":"B","text":"复数"},{"key":"C","text":"is 的缩写"},{"key":"D","text":"has 的缩写"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"Jack's sister 是杰克的姐姐。","verify":"\"所属关系「的」\""},{"id":"cne_j246_q4","topicId":"cne_j246","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"Lily and Lucy's room 表示？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"两人共有的一个房间"},{"key":"B","text":"Lucy 不在房间"},{"key":"C","text":"Lily 一人的房间"},{"key":"D","text":"两人各自的房间"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"共有只在最后一个名词后加 's。","verify":"\"两人共有的一个房间\""}]
